invalid type: string "Future of ICT\nPredictions for Future:\nEven more connected world More automation and AI\nAdvanced healthcare technology Sustainable and green technology\nPersonalized education Global collaboration\nImportant Messages:\n\"It is our responsibility to use ICT in a responsible manner\"\n\"Understanding ICT helps us adapt to future changes\"\nters:\nENIAC\nEDVAC\nEDSAC\nUNIVAC\n